我男朋友说范范你今天晚上吃的很多
Wǒ nánpéngyou shuō Fàn Fàn nǐ jīntiān wǎnshàng chī de hěnduō
My boyfriend said Fanfan, you ate a lot tonight

505
00:20:39,866 --> 00:20:41,033
我们走一走吧
Wǒmen zǒu yì zǒu ba
Let's take a walk

506
00:20:41,033 --> 00:20:42,266
我们走回去
Wǒmen zǒu huíqù
We walk back

507
00:20:43,433 --> 00:20:44,466
我说远不远
Wǒ shuō yuǎn bù yuǎn
I said it's far

508
00:20:44,700 --> 00:20:46,600
他说不远不远
Tā shuō bù yuǎn bù yuǎn
He said it's not far away

509
00:20:46,800 --> 00:20:48,300
然后我们就一直走
Ránhòu wǒmen jiù yìzhí zǒu
Then we kept walking

510
00:20:48,400 --> 00:20:50,266
走了一个多小时
Zǒule yígè duō xiǎoshí
Walked for more than an hour

511
00:20:50,266 --> 00:20:51,533
我觉得我要累死了
Wǒ juédé wǒ yào lèisǐle
I feel like I'm dying of exhaustion.

512
00:20:51,633 --> 00:20:53,433
我说你不是说不远吗
Wǒ shuō nǐ búshì shuō bù yuǎn ma
I said, didn't you say it wasn't far?

513
00:20:53,700 --> 00:20:55,900
他说这个对于我来说不远呀
Tā shuō zhège duìyú wǒ lái shuō bù yuǎn ya
He said it's not far for me.

514
00:20:56,000 --> 00:20:59,133
我出去跑步我可以一直跑3个小时
Wǒ chūqù pǎobù wǒ kěyǐ yìzhí pǎo 3 gè xiǎoshí
I go out for a run and I can run for 3 hours

515
00:20:59,333 --> 00:21:02,400
所以如果你问我的话都是不远
Suǒyǐ rúguǒ nǐ wèn wǒ dehuà dōu shì bù yuǎn
So if you ask me, it's not far

516
00:21:03,133 --> 00:21:04,300
气死我了
Qìsǐ wǒle
I'm so mad

517
00:21:04,300 --> 00:21:05,666
累死我了
Lèisǐ wǒle
I'm so tired

518
00:21:06,033 --> 00:21:06,500
对
Duì
right

519
00:21:06,500 --> 00:21:09,266
但是我妈妈和我妹妹他们很喜欢走
Dànshì wǒ māmā hé wǒ mèimei tāmen hěn xǐhuān zǒu
But my mother and my sister like to walk very much

520
00:21:09,933 --> 00:21:11,200
然后我妈说
Ránhòu wǒ mā shuō
Then my mother said

521
00:21:12,033 --> 00:21:15,066
现在都已经12点了
Xiànzài dōu yǐjīng 12 diǎnle
It's already 12 o'clock

522
00:21:15,133 --> 00:21:18,466
怎么外面的饭店还都开着门
Zěnme wàimiàn de fàndiàn hái dōu kāizhe mén
Why are all the restaurants outside still open?

523
00:21:18,666 --> 00:21:20,400
这在咱们老家
Zhè zài zánmen lǎojiā
This is in our hometown

524
00:21:20,633 --> 00:21:24,900
可能晚上6点多7点多大家就睡觉了
Kěnéng wǎnshàng 6 diǎn duō 7 diǎn duō dàjiā jiù shuìjiàole
Maybe everyone goes to bed around 6 or 7 pm

525
00:21:25,100 --> 00:21:26,433
然后我妹妹说
Ránhòu wǒ mèimei shuō
Then my sister said

526
00:21:26,533 --> 00:21:28,066
你那个小农村
Nǐ nàgè xiǎo nóngcūn
Your small village

527
00:21:28,066 --> 00:21:31,400
怎么可以跟这个大城市比
Zěnme kěyǐ gēn zhège dà chéngshì bǐ
How can it compare with this big city?

528
00:21:31,400 --> 00:21:33,066
是完全不一样的
Shì wánquán bù yíyàng de
It's completely different

529
00:21:33,266 --> 00:21:36,200
那昨天晚上你睡觉好不好
Nà zuótiān wǎnshàng nǐ shuìjiào hǎobù hǎo
Did you sleep well last night?

530
00:21:36,333 --> 00:21:38,733
因为你说你很累
Yīnwèi nǐ shuō nǐ hěn lèi
Because you said you were tired

531
00:21:38,733 --> 00:21:41,400
对昨天晚上我很累
Duì zuótiān wǎnshàng wǒ hěn lèi
I was very tired last night.

532
00:21:41,666 --> 00:21:43,933
然后我两点多就睡觉了
Ránhòu wǒ liǎng diǎn duō jiù shuìjiàole
Then I went to bed at around two o'clock

533
00:21:44,400 --> 00:21:47,500
我睡觉的时候我男朋友他没有回来
Wǒ shuìjiào de shíhou wǒ nánpéngyou tā méiyǒu huílái
My boyfriend didn't come back when I went to bed

534
00:21:47,700 --> 00:21:49,400
然后他也没有带钥匙
Ránhòu tā yě méiyǒu dài yàoshi
And he didn't bring the key.

535
00:21:49,500 --> 00:21:52,500
我在想如果你现在不回来
Wǒ zài xiǎng rúguǒ nǐ xiànzài bù huílái
I'm thinking if you don't come back now

536
00:21:52,500 --> 00:21:53,733
你就不要回来了
Nǐ jiù búyào huíláile
You don't have to come back

537
00:21:53,800 --> 00:21:56,466
因为你会影响我睡觉
Yīnwèi nǐ huì yǐngxiǎng wǒ shuìjiào
Because you disturb my sleep

538
00:21:56,700 --> 00:21:58,133
我就给他打了一个电话
Wǒ jiù gěi tā dǎle yígè diànhuà
I called him

539
00:21:58,133 --> 00:22:00,800
我说你怎么还没回来
Wǒ shuō nǐ zěnme hái méi huílái
I said why haven't you come back yet?

540
00:22:01,066 --> 00:22:03,400
他说在跟他的朋友打球
Tā shuō zài gēn tā de péngyou dǎqiú
He said he was playing ball with his friends.

541
00:22:03,433 --> 00:22:05,600
我说啊那你不要回来了
Wǒ shuō a nà nǐ búyào huíláile
I said, then don't come back

542
00:22:05,633 --> 00:22:07,666
你去你的工作室睡觉吧
Nǐ qù nǐ de gōngzuò shì shuìjiào ba
Go to your studio and sleep.

543
00:22:07,833 --> 00:22:10,633
他的公司就在我的家旁边
Tā de gōngsī jiù zài wǒ de jiā pángbiān
His company is next to my home.

544
00:22:10,800 --> 00:22:13,666
那边可以有睡觉的地方
Nàbian kěyǐ yǒu shuìjiào de dìfāng
There's a place to sleep over there.

545
00:22:13,733 --> 00:22:14,666
他说那好吧
Tā shuō nà hǎo ba
He said okay

546
00:22:14,666 --> 00:22:16,033
那我去那边睡了
Nà wǒ qù nàbian shuìle
Then I went to sleep over there.

547
00:22:16,200 --> 00:22:19,533
所以昨天晚上我睡得还可以
Suǒyǐ zuótiān wǎnshàng wǒ shuì de hái kěyǐ
So I slept okay last night.

548
00:22:19,733 --> 00:22:23,000
所以你的男朋友晚上2点他在打球
Suǒyǐ nǐ de nánpéngyou wǎnshàng 2 diǎn tā zài dǎqiú
So your boyfriend is playing basketball at 2 o'clock in the evening

549
00:22:23,000 --> 00:22:25,333
对他有时候打一晚上的球
Duì tā yǒu shíhòu dǎ yì wǎnshàng de qiú
Sometimes he plays ball all night.

550
00:22:25,466 --> 00:22:28,400
你知道他非常非常喜欢台球
Nǐ zhīdào tā fēicháng fēicháng xǐhuān táiqiú
You know he really likes billiards.

551
00:22:28,533 --> 00:22:30,733
我觉得很多英国的英国人
Wǒ juédé hěnduō Yīngguó de Yīngguó rén
I think a lot of British people in the UK

552
00:22:30,733 --> 00:22:32,266
会喜欢这个运动
Huì xǐhuān zhège yùndòng
Will love this sport

553
00:22:32,800 --> 00:22:34,833
英国的台球叫斯诺克
Yīngguó de táiqiú jiào sīnuòkè
British billiards is called snooker

554
00:22:35,133 --> 00:22:38,633
然后我男朋友非常喜欢这个运动
Ránhòu wǒ nánpéngyou fēicháng xǐhuān zhège yùndòng
Then my boyfriend likes this sport very much

555
00:22:38,733 --> 00:22:41,133
他可以打一晚上的球
Tā kěyǐ dǎ yì wǎnshàng de qiú
He can play ball all night.

556
00:22:41,133 --> 00:22:42,233
他都不会累
Tā dōu bú huì lèi
He won't get tired

557
00:22:42,633 --> 00:22:46,433
所以你男朋友比你熬夜更厉害
Suǒyǐ nǐ de nánpéngyou bǐ nǐ áoyè gèng lìhài
So your boyfriend stays up more late than you do.

558
00:22:46,433 --> 00:22:48,800
是的他比我熬夜更厉害
Shì de tā bǐ wǒ áoyè gèng lìhài
Yes, he stays up more late than me.

559
00:22:48,900 --> 00:22:49,700
所以蔚萱
Suǒyǐ Wèi Xuān
So Weixuan

560
00:22:49,700 --> 00:22:55,533
我没有找到那个比我早睡的人
Wǒ méiyǒu zhǎodào nàgè bǐ wǒ zǎo shuì de rén
I didn't find anyone who went to bed earlier than me.

561
00:22:55,666 --> 00:22:56,900
要不要换一个男朋友
Yào búyào huàn yígè nánpéngyou
Do you want to change your boyfriend?

562
00:22:56,900 --> 00:22:58,133
可以考虑一下
Kěyǐ kǎolǜ yíxià
Consider it

563
00:22:58,133 --> 00:23:01,166
对为了我的这个非常好的睡眠
Duì wèile wǒ de zhège fēicháng hǎo de shuìmián
For my very good sleep

564
00:23:01,166 --> 00:23:02,300
为了我的身体
Wèile wǒ de shēntǐ
For my body

565
00:23:02,300 --> 00:23:08,233
我觉得这个我真的要认真的考虑一下
Wǒ juédé zhège wǒ zhēn de yào rènzhēn de kǎolǜ yíxià
I think I really need to think about this seriously.

